WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:08.540
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:08.540 --> 00:15.500
Towards a far, faraway place

00:28.860 --> 00:35.060
Blown by the wind, we walk on

00:35.060 --> 00:42.030
Wanting to know the reason we were born

00:42.240 --> 00:48.540
Even if a time of loss should come

00:48.540 --> 00:55.680
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

00:58.120 --> 01:05.530
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:05.530 --> 01:11.500
Towards something we can't lose

01:11.500 --> 01:19.140
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:19.140 --> 01:26.010
Towards a far, faraway place

01:32.420 --> 01:35.550
Episode 13
Hurtling Power

01:41.330 --> 01:42.660
Where are we going now?

01:42.660 --> 01:43.930
To Zed.

01:43.930 --> 01:47.240
What? You know where Zed is?

01:47.240 --> 01:49.340
Is Zed alive too then?

01:49.340 --> 01:50.540
Most likely.

01:50.540 --> 01:53.640
What? What do you mean, "is he alive"?!

01:53.640 --> 01:55.610
Hey, answer me!

02:01.750 --> 02:05.210
For you to have recovered so well
from such grave injuries...

02:05.950 --> 02:10.580
Impressive as ever, former king Bakkam.

02:14.560 --> 02:17.570
Are you awake, your majesty?

02:17.570 --> 02:20.360
Hugh, is that you?

02:23.670 --> 02:27.130
Then, I shall have your father undo the seal.

02:28.840 --> 02:32.280
Father cannot be alive.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.250
Do not let Hugh lead you astray!

02:36.220 --> 02:37.920
What of Rebecca?

02:37.920 --> 02:39.920
How is Rebecca?

02:39.920 --> 02:41.690
She is doing quite well.

02:41.690 --> 02:43.960
She will be a bride soon.

02:43.960 --> 02:45.860
Congratulations.

02:45.860 --> 02:47.400
A bride?

02:47.400 --> 02:50.570
I suppose you are to be the groom, Hugh.

02:50.570 --> 02:56.530
Naturally, that depends on your wishes,
your majesty.

03:00.210 --> 03:03.040
Hugh's ambitions have caused all of this.

03:03.040 --> 03:06.340
He has taken everything away from me.

03:07.920 --> 03:09.650
I see...

03:09.650 --> 03:13.090
Hugh once served as my father's right hand,

03:13.090 --> 03:15.720
and his skills commanded the respect of all.

03:16.160 --> 03:21.960
I, a novice shard caster, also learned
many things from him.

03:29.870 --> 03:33.330
You make quite a bit of unnecessary motion
when you cast your spells.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.210
What's the matter?

03:36.210 --> 03:38.180
Are you finished?

03:38.180 --> 03:40.080
I can't do it.

03:40.080 --> 03:42.210
I don't think I can become strong.

03:44.220 --> 03:46.020
It's all right.

03:47.190 --> 03:51.390
You have inherited the blood of
the great King Bakkam.

03:51.390 --> 03:53.360
I am sure you will become strong.

03:54.160 --> 03:58.620
You will become stronger than anyone,
and more beautiful.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.960
I was...

04:28.230 --> 04:30.200
I was naïve!

04:31.200 --> 04:34.500
I never imagined he could betray me.

04:36.170 --> 04:40.300
He took control of me, and made me...

04:44.750 --> 04:47.040
Re..Rebecca...

04:49.650 --> 04:51.250
Regardless of the reasons,

04:51.250 --> 04:54.460
it's still the truth that I attacked my father.

04:54.460 --> 04:57.580
These hands are stained with my father's blood.

05:03.200 --> 05:05.200
You fold it like this...

05:05.200 --> 05:07.670
And then go like this...

05:07.970 --> 05:09.770
Okay, done!

05:10.670 --> 05:12.440
Fly it, fly it!

05:12.440 --> 05:14.240
Here it goes!

05:14.710 --> 05:17.840
Wow, cool!

05:27.390 --> 05:31.630
Wow, I didn't know paper planes
could fly so far.

05:31.630 --> 05:34.600
Must be nice to be free like that.

05:36.830 --> 05:39.070
You sure look pretty free to me.

05:39.070 --> 05:40.860
Yeah, right!

05:41.940 --> 05:43.740
You're so quick to get angry.

05:43.740 --> 05:45.040
What's with that, Noah?

05:45.040 --> 05:48.010
You're basically trying to say I'm
immature, aren't you?!

05:53.780 --> 05:54.980
Zed...

05:54.980 --> 05:57.950
Where are you right now,
and what are you up to?

05:59.290 --> 06:04.830
Sagiri seems to have taken quite a liking to you.

06:04.830 --> 06:07.100
I hope she's not a burden on you.

06:07.100 --> 06:09.900
No, I'll enjoying her company too.

06:09.900 --> 06:11.690
All right.

06:12.670 --> 06:16.200
She has been all alone since she was very small.

06:16.200 --> 06:19.660
She's probably happy because she thinks
she's gained a family in you.

06:20.210 --> 06:22.910
I'm the one who should thank you all.

06:22.910 --> 06:25.210
I've done nothing but take advantage
of your kindness.

06:26.750 --> 06:29.450
You're a mysterious person.

06:29.450 --> 06:32.350
You've been with us for some time now,

06:32.350 --> 06:35.480
but you haven't asked us anything
about ourselves.

06:36.690 --> 06:38.490
That's true...

06:40.930 --> 06:44.730
Huh? I'm sure it fell around here somewhere...

06:47.170 --> 06:49.470
Here, it's yours, right?

06:50.510 --> 06:52.130
Thanks!

06:55.840 --> 06:57.480
What's wrong?

06:57.480 --> 06:59.250
Nothing...

06:59.250 --> 07:00.870
Later!

07:02.380 --> 07:05.350
Sagiri, it's time to go!

07:05.590 --> 07:07.210
Okay!

07:09.660 --> 07:12.090
They tell me Rebecca's disappeared!

07:12.090 --> 07:13.760
What's the meaning of this?!

07:13.760 --> 07:15.400
Don't worry.

07:15.400 --> 07:18.190
The preparations for the wedding are
proceeding according to plan.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.800
You don't get it at all!

07:20.800 --> 07:23.440
I gave up everything to come to Zymot!

07:23.440 --> 07:25.740
There's no other future for me!

07:25.740 --> 07:28.870
Leave Rebecca to me.

07:29.710 --> 07:32.150
More importantly, the match with Robès...

07:32.150 --> 07:37.280
If you were to be defeated, you
would lose everything.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.050
That's what you're worried about?

07:39.050 --> 07:41.020
I won't lose to anyone!

07:41.420 --> 07:44.460
You should worry about your own safety.

07:44.460 --> 07:47.400
If you were to betray me,

07:47.400 --> 07:49.860
you would not live another day!

07:57.310 --> 07:58.910
Move!

07:58.910 --> 08:00.140
What's with you?!

08:00.140 --> 08:02.810
Damn it, who does that bastard think he is?

08:02.810 --> 08:04.780
He's absolutely revolting.

08:05.680 --> 08:09.680
There's no way I want someone
like that in our circle!

08:09.680 --> 08:12.150
He's ultimately nothing but a sacrificial pawn.

08:13.090 --> 08:16.720
A person's fate is not so easily changed.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.030
What?!

08:20.030 --> 08:22.150
Why, you! What is the meaning of this?!

08:23.260 --> 08:25.300
Is it finally my turn for some action?

08:25.300 --> 08:27.270
I'm so tired of waiting.

08:30.870 --> 08:33.000
Hey, where is Zed?

08:33.640 --> 08:37.250
I believe if he has obtained the power,
we will see him any moment.

08:37.250 --> 08:38.610
Power?

08:38.610 --> 08:42.080
Did you tell Zed about that spring?

08:42.080 --> 08:43.480
Yes!

08:43.480 --> 08:45.990
Wait, what? Tell me all about it.

08:45.990 --> 08:48.790
Basically, the deal is that I got a new spirit.

08:51.330 --> 08:52.990
Zed!

08:52.990 --> 08:54.620
Zed!

08:57.030 --> 08:58.830
Oh, you moron!

09:01.600 --> 09:02.040
You're such a moron!

09:02.040 --> 09:03.140
Hey!
You're such a moron!

09:03.140 --> 09:04.410
Cut it out!

09:04.410 --> 09:05.610
I'm telling you, that hurts!

09:05.610 --> 09:06.610
It seriously hurts!

09:06.610 --> 09:07.780
Moron! Moron!

09:07.780 --> 09:10.010
Do you have any idea how worried I was?!

09:10.010 --> 09:11.980
How should I know?
Sheesh!

09:14.350 --> 09:16.480
What? Marry Dumas?

09:19.150 --> 09:23.280
That bastard, so this is what he
meant by " changing his fate" ?

09:23.860 --> 09:25.830
So, what's the plan?

09:27.130 --> 09:28.800
I'm sorry!

09:28.800 --> 09:31.530
I'll go back to the castle after all.

09:31.530 --> 09:32.570
Princess Rebecca!

09:32.570 --> 09:33.570
Why?!

09:33.570 --> 09:36.770
You mustn't think of sacrificing yourself!

09:36.770 --> 09:40.980
My father may be alive, so...

09:40.980 --> 09:42.710
King Bakkam?

09:42.710 --> 09:44.950
You would place your faith in Hugh's words?!

09:44.950 --> 09:46.510
It has to be a trap!

09:46.510 --> 09:47.520
She's right!

09:47.520 --> 09:49.620
If they catch you, they'll make you get married,

09:49.620 --> 09:51.740
and your whole life will be ruined!

09:53.420 --> 09:54.420
I'm sorry!

09:54.420 --> 09:56.220
Princess Rebecca!

09:57.060 --> 09:58.760
Hey, Zed, stop her!

09:58.760 --> 10:02.300
She thought it over before she decided, right?

10:02.300 --> 10:03.860
I can't say anything to her.

10:03.860 --> 10:05.490
But...

10:08.440 --> 10:10.730
Rebecca, wait! Hey!

10:17.080 --> 10:18.410
Father...

10:18.410 --> 10:22.710
If you are alive, I want to see you now!
Right away!

10:29.120 --> 10:30.750
Elmeida!

10:32.230 --> 10:36.030
I came to bring you back, little lost princess.

10:43.870 --> 10:44.970
Cheeky girl...

10:44.970 --> 10:46.770
Princess Rebecca!

10:47.040 --> 10:48.670
Zakua!

10:55.920 --> 10:57.390
Time to go home, Zakua.

10:57.390 --> 10:59.350
Elda! Rebecca!

11:01.660 --> 11:04.860
Why, if it isn't the Templar girl who ran away.

11:04.860 --> 11:06.990
Take her along too.

11:14.800 --> 11:17.100
Zed!

11:23.040 --> 11:25.110
Hey, Elda, are you okay?

11:25.110 --> 11:26.910
Snap out of it!

11:27.180 --> 11:30.150
S..Save Princess Rebecca...

11:34.190 --> 11:35.820
Damn it...

11:36.490 --> 11:39.950
Just you wait; I'll rescue you no matter what.

11:59.980 --> 12:02.050
Today's the day at last.

12:02.050 --> 12:05.790
I've always wanted to bring you
down with my own hands.

12:05.790 --> 12:08.690
Oh, so we're like-minded in some ways.

12:08.690 --> 12:10.590
I feel the same, Dumas.

12:10.590 --> 12:13.060
Stop it! Let me go!

12:15.900 --> 12:18.520
My my, so you came back?

12:19.670 --> 12:21.440
Did you get to see Zed?

12:21.440 --> 12:22.640
How can you be so relaxed?!

12:22.640 --> 12:24.310
Look in front of you!

12:24.310 --> 12:26.100
Take this!

12:35.480 --> 12:39.940
I'll defeat you lot here, and
become the king of Zymot!

12:42.460 --> 12:43.560
Did you hear that?

12:43.560 --> 12:45.690
The next king of Zymot, he said!

12:45.690 --> 12:47.760
Just watching him pisses me off.

12:47.760 --> 12:49.730
You take things from here.

12:51.070 --> 12:56.640
Whether Dumas wins or loses tonight's match,

12:56.640 --> 12:59.770
I'll count on you to dispose of him, Glaudio.

13:06.780 --> 13:10.910
A private wedding with just the two
of us could be rather nice.

13:12.150 --> 13:15.950
So, this time you'll betray that
Dumas person as well?

13:16.420 --> 13:21.380
He may want to marry the princess,
but he is fated to die before that.

13:21.930 --> 13:26.430
In the end, I'm the only one who
can wed the princess.

13:26.430 --> 13:29.470
I no longer have any desire to speak with you.

13:29.470 --> 13:31.510
I do not even want to see your face.

13:31.510 --> 13:34.470
But there's something on your mind.

13:35.510 --> 13:40.640
Yes, your honored father is quite alive.

13:47.720 --> 13:50.850
F..Father?

13:52.160 --> 13:54.130
I don't just have electric attacks!

14:12.750 --> 14:15.080
You live up to your reputation, Dumas,

14:15.080 --> 14:17.380
but the fight's just beginning.

14:25.830 --> 14:27.660
Father...

14:27.660 --> 14:31.030
You... You survived...

14:31.030 --> 14:33.930
Listen well, Rebecca.

14:33.930 --> 14:36.730
You must marry Hugh.

14:37.570 --> 14:39.470
Why...

14:39.470 --> 14:40.610
Father, why?!

14:40.610 --> 14:45.180
There is no one else in Zymot whose
power can compare to Hugh's !

14:45.180 --> 14:47.310
B..But...

14:49.320 --> 14:53.950
This is the man who seized control
of my body and tried to kill you!

14:53.950 --> 14:55.420
That's right,

14:55.420 --> 14:58.390
but that is the Zymot way of life.

14:59.260 --> 15:04.030
We strive to fulfill our desires,
using whatever means necessary.

15:04.030 --> 15:07.330
Hugh is the Zymotan soul personified.

15:08.100 --> 15:10.170
I lost to Hugh.

15:10.170 --> 15:12.770
Certainly it rankles, but it is fact.

15:12.770 --> 15:16.730
That is precisely what makes him
suitable to be my successor.

15:17.310 --> 15:20.940
And you must be aware...

15:21.650 --> 15:25.280
Rebecca, you love Hugh.

15:26.090 --> 15:28.210
You have for a long time.

15:34.930 --> 15:38.470
We must not let the royal bloodline die out.

15:38.470 --> 15:41.090
You understand that, don't you, Rebecca?

15:57.250 --> 15:58.880
Die!

16:02.360 --> 16:04.120
Interfering woman...

16:04.120 --> 16:05.920
Drop dead!

16:10.630 --> 16:12.900
I don't need your meddling.

16:12.900 --> 16:14.640
But your right hand is...

16:14.640 --> 16:16.600
It's nothing to worry about.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.900
My left hand will be plenty for this.

16:22.340 --> 16:24.810
That's enough tough talk.

16:24.810 --> 16:27.410
This was fun, Robès,

16:27.410 --> 16:29.680
but it's over now.

16:29.680 --> 16:31.650
It isn’t over yet!

16:38.090 --> 16:39.890
Who's there?

16:45.700 --> 16:47.630
Zed!

16:47.630 --> 16:49.570
Roya...

16:49.570 --> 16:52.540
Roya, I’m sorry.

16:54.640 --> 16:58.780
Good grief, so my time to shine
is over for today.

16:58.780 --> 17:00.050
Where's Rebecca?

17:00.050 --> 17:02.020
She's being held somewhere else.

17:02.720 --> 17:05.090
Hey, Zed...

17:05.090 --> 17:08.020
You're playing the hero when
you're totally powerless?!

17:08.020 --> 17:10.490
Have you matured a little?

17:10.490 --> 17:13.290
I, your teacher, will be the judge!

17:42.890 --> 17:44.520
Damn it...

17:49.160 --> 17:50.790
Slugna!

18:00.940 --> 18:02.570
What?

18:03.210 --> 18:07.340
When did this boy get so powerful?

18:08.020 --> 18:09.850
Dumas!

18:09.850 --> 18:12.520
I wanted to come find you and
bust you in the jaw,

18:12.520 --> 18:14.490
but now I don't care anymore!

18:14.890 --> 18:16.790
But even so...

18:16.790 --> 18:19.920
I'll never forgive you for betraying everybody!

18:27.730 --> 18:29.200
Glaudio!

18:29.200 --> 18:31.500
I've got no use for losers.

18:32.910 --> 18:34.840
Stop it!

18:34.840 --> 18:37.970
I'm much stronger than this.

18:52.160 --> 18:54.790
Now, it's your turn!

18:56.260 --> 18:58.230
That's unforgivable.

19:01.440 --> 19:06.900
With the vows you have sworn by the
holy sword, you two are now one.

19:08.440 --> 19:12.610
Now, I am officially your successor.

19:12.610 --> 19:14.580
I ask you to give the spirit to me.

19:15.850 --> 19:20.310
Very well, I shall now release
the seal on the spirit.

19:48.650 --> 19:50.280
Father!

19:50.680 --> 19:52.250
Father!

19:52.250 --> 19:54.250
Please, stay with me, Father!

19:54.250 --> 19:55.490
Father!

19:55.490 --> 19:57.460
Please, wake up!

20:03.800 --> 20:05.590
Princess Rebecca!

20:06.230 --> 20:08.770
Why you, Hugh!

20:08.770 --> 20:10.570
You will pay!

20:25.690 --> 20:28.590
I have no use for you anymore.

20:28.590 --> 20:31.060
You may go wherever you like.

21:26.610 --> 21:28.240
Rebecca!

21:33.020 --> 21:35.190
Come on, hang in there, Elda!

21:35.190 --> 21:37.520
Stay with us! Hey!

21:37.520 --> 21:42.150
Take care... of Princess... Rebe...

21:45.170 --> 21:47.230
Hey, Elda...

21:47.230 --> 21:49.170
Elda!

21:49.170 --> 21:50.970
Elda!

22:00.880 --> 22:02.920
If I'm ...

22:02.920 --> 22:05.540
If I'm reborn...

22:06.520 --> 22:09.150
That's right, I want to be a bird.

22:10.190 --> 22:14.650
I'll become a bird, and fly freely in the sky.

22:16.160 --> 22:18.630
If I'm to be reborn...

22:20.200 --> 22:23.170
I don't want it to be as me!

22:50.400 --> 22:54.270
I want to peak inside your heart, and find
out your feelings and expressions

22:54.270 --> 22:58.170
I see you bearing your burden alone, and don't
ask the reason for your twinkling tears

22:58.170 --> 23:01.740
I give you a shout of support without mentioning
them, between the answers I'm looking for

23:01.740 --> 23:05.870
Without obsessing or over thinking,
I feel sunbeams in the future you

23:07.580 --> 23:09.420
It feels nice, very, very much

23:09.420 --> 23:11.220
You and me, we're very, very good

23:11.220 --> 23:15.090
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:15.090 --> 23:16.920
Very, very much, whenever

23:16.920 --> 23:18.760
Very, very good, not changing

23:18.760 --> 23:24.720
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

23:30.240 --> 23:32.710
I feel this kindness amidst my doubt

23:34.010 --> 23:36.480
I will always have faith in you at all times

23:37.740 --> 23:41.650
Here in this vast landscape
under the sunny blue sky

23:41.650 --> 23:45.780
We got good feelings, good social standing,
we're good; I want to always be here

23:47.250 --> 23:49.060
It feels nice, very, very much

23:49.060 --> 23:50.890
You and me, we're very, very good

23:50.890 --> 23:54.690
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:54.690 --> 23:56.560
Very, very much, whenever

23:56.560 --> 23:58.430
Very, very good, not changing

23:58.430 --> 24:04.390
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

24:16.480 --> 24:19.940
Next Time
The Lure of Power

24:16.880 --> 24:19.940


Next time, "The Lure of Power"
